OL,3,GNEWSASearch for buried asbestos at
OL,4,Aderelict factory site
OL,5,
OL,6,FA derelict factory site in Greater
OL,7,FManchester that has been described as
OL,8,F"Rochdale's Chernobyl" is being
OL,9,Fexcavated in an attempt to locate
OL,10,Fburied asbestos.
OL,12,FThe old Turner Brothers factory in
OL,13,FSpotland was once the world's largest
OL,14,Fproducer of the toxic material.
OL,16,FIn recent years the site has been a
OL,17,Fmagnet for disorder and trespass by
OL,18,Fso-called urban explorers.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
