OL,3,GNEWSASearch for buried asbestos at
OL,4,Aderelict factory site
OL,5,
OL,6,FOwner Spodden Park Ltd will carry out
OL,7,Finvestigations to locate where asbestos
OL,8,Fhas been buried on the site, which has
OL,9,Fan area of about 75 acres (30
OL,10,Fhectares).
